<p>Huesca sits about 74 kilometers north of Zaragoza, and a private chauffeur transfer covers that distance in around 1 hour under normal traffic conditions. The route runs almost entirely along the A-23 motorway, a fast, well-maintained road that connects the Ebro valley with the foothills of the Pyrenees, so there is little in the way of traffic congestion or complicated navigation to account for. It is one of the more straightforward transfers out of Zaragoza, both in terms of driving time and road quality.</p>
